{
  "name": "icon",
  "type": "registry:ui",
  "title": "图标 Icon",
  "description": "基于 Lucide 的可搜索图标集合与无障碍渲染组件。",
  "import": "import { Icon, iconColorVariants, iconSizes } from \"@/components/ui/icon\"",
  "exports": [
    "Icon",
    "iconColorVariants",
    "iconSizes"
  ],
  "typeExports": [
    "IconColor",
    "IconProps",
    "IconSize"
  ],
  "install": {
    "wui": "pnpm dlx @wui-design/cli@latest add @wui/icon",
    "shadcn": "pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add https://ui.wzx.wang/r/icon.json",
    "npmDependencies": [
      "lucide-react"
    ],
    "registryDependencies": []
  },
  "props": [
    {
      "name": "icon",
      "type": "LucideIcon",
      "required": true,
      "control": "text",
      "description": "要渲染的 Lucide 图标组件。"
    },
    {
      "name": "size",
      "type": "number | \"sm\" | \"lg\" | \"md\" | \"xs\" | \"xl\"",
      "required": false,
      "control": "text",
      "defaultValue": "md",
      "description": "图标尺寸名称，或精确的像素值。"
    },
    {
      "name": "variant",
      "type": "\"default\" | \"secondary\" | \"destructive\" | \"success\" | \"warning\" | \"info\" | \"primary\" | \"muted\"",
      "required": false,
      "control": "select",
      "options": [
        "default",
        "secondary",
        "destructive",
        "success",
        "warning",
        "info",
        "primary",
        "muted"
      ],
      "defaultValue": "default",
      "description": "图标使用的语义文字颜色。"
    },
    {
      "name": "color",
      "type": "Color",
      "required": false,
      "control": "text",
      "description": "自定义 CSS/SVG 颜色。设置后会覆盖 variant。"
    },
    {
      "name": "label",
      "type": "string",
      "required": false,
      "control": "text",
      "description": "图标的无障碍名称。纯装饰图标无需设置。"
    }
  ],
  "usage": "```tsx\nimport { SearchIcon } from \"lucide-react\"\n\nimport { Icon } from \"@/components/ui/icon\"\n\n<Icon icon={SearchIcon} />\n<Icon icon={SearchIcon} size=\"lg\" strokeWidth={1.75} />\n<Icon icon={SearchIcon} label=\"搜索\" />\n```\n\n`label` 为空时，图标会被视为装饰并对辅助技术隐藏。如果图标单独传达含义，请提供 `label`；如果图标位于已经有文字\n或 `aria-label` 的按钮内，则保持装饰状态，避免读屏器把同一名称读两遍。",
  "examples": [
    {
      "name": "icon-demo",
      "title": "基础用法"
    },
    {
      "name": "icon-colors",
      "title": "颜色变体"
    }
  ],
  "files": [
    "registry/ui/icon.tsx"
  ],
  "docsUrl": "https://ui.wzx.wang/docs/components/icon",
  "sourceUrl": "https://ui.wzx.wang/r/icon.json"
}
